---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<BaseLayout title="Home" description="Meet Shreya Roongta, an educator and emerging learning designer focused on curriculum, instructional design, and meaningful learning experiences.">
<section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Hello, I’m</p><h1>Shreya Roongta.</h1><p class="hero-headline">Educator · Learning Designer · Curriculum Developer</p><p class="lede">I began my career as a teacher in India and later moved to the United States. Now I’m pursuing graduate study in Learning Design and Technology, building on my experience with learners to create thoughtful, meaningful learning experiences.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href={withBase('about/')}>More about me</a><a class="button secondary" href={withBase('projects/')}>Explore my work</a></div></div><figure class="hero-portrait"><div class="portrait-frame"><img src={withBase('images/shreya-roongta.jpg?v=2')} width="1122" height="1402" alt="Shreya Roongta seated outdoors on a lawn" fetchpriority="high"/></div><figcaption>Learning through curiosity, reflection, and thoughtful design.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="focus-heading"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Areas of focus</p><h2 id="focus-heading">Designing with purpose</h2></div><div class="three-grid"><article><span class="number">01</span><h3>Learning experiences</h3><p>Connecting learner needs, clear goals, and thoughtful design decisions.</p></article><article><span class="number">02</span><h3>Curriculum development</h3><p>Shaping content and resources into coherent, useful learning pathways.</p></article><article><span class="number">03</span><h3>Educational technology</h3><p>Exploring how technology can support access, engagement, and understanding.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section tint"><div class="shell selected-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h2>A portfolio designed to grow</h2></div><div><p>Selected case studies and learning-design projects will be added throughout my MSLDT journey. Each will document the challenge, process, solution, and reflection behind the work.</p><a class="text-link" href={withBase('projects/')}>Visit the project collection <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
